tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/bec61ab4ada1ff335ca2051bed60462e.mp4?t=1741930837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/912b55e1d209a953ef48a6051fbfb0c9.poster.avif?t=1741930837\" width=572 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/912b55e1d209a953ef48a6051fbfb0c9.webm?t=1741930837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/912b55e1d209a953ef48a6051fbfb0c9.mp4?t=1741930837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/440bed238639bda0394fcbf8cc585b39.avif?t=1741930837\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy fast-paced and addictive gameplay with a wide range of characters and abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the firepower of the Warcluck to the trap-laying expertise of the Mouscle, each Character has unique skills and tactics.  With endless replayability, build and upgrade your defenses, lead your troops, and defeat waves of enemies. Choose from a variety of unique heroes and discover new strategies with each playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/c3e74ee5892d74f2748f765728923382.poster.avif?t=1741930837\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/c3e74ee5892d74f2748f7657289233